    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Desire: Mrs. Claus, the Christmas spirit is in danger, and it's up to you to help 18 Santa Clauses spread across the world. Each of them has unique needs, and it's your mission to satisfy their desires to save Christmas. Get into the holiday spirit while exercising your mind and exciting your senses with this captivating game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743040/extras/e2088ed3e32572c8753271446b0429d0.poster.avif?t=1739983901\" width=616 height=184 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743040/extras/e2088ed3e32572c8753271446b0429d0.webm?t=1739983901\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2743040/extras/e2088ed3e32572c8753271446b0429d0.mp4?t=1739983901\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >We have:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >18 unique levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Indication if the piece is in the correct place (\u2705).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy achievement completion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story mode with little text and lots of humor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Several different endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Photo gallery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Super hot Santa Clauses for all tastes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Mysterious Gift.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quality soundtrack.</p></li></ul>",
